    "turn_text": "So I want to dig in to your on the Senate Judiciary Committee. There's a hearing titled Rule by District Judges to Exploring Legislative Solutions to the bipartisan problem of universal injunctions. Walk us through the hearing, the goal of it, the importance of it.",
